Utilizing pull requests allows me to streamline a few additional things with GitHub Workflows and automate (more on the last three in Portfolio Deployment):

Spellchecking relevant files and looking for broken links as part of PR checks.
Rendering and deploying the rendered files to Netlify for an open PR to my staging site.
Generating release notes from PRs tagged with specific labels.
Rendering and deploying the rendered files to GitHub Pages production site when the PR is merged into main.

